WEBVTT

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:10.150
When are you going to leave?

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.190
At the end of the month.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.070
That's so soon!

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.950
I have to make it for their entrance ceremony.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.930
This is all so sudden.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:22.790
Hey, announce your hit!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.060
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.060
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.560
I decided this myself

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.560
I decided that relying on chance

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:54.070
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.030
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:04.950
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:09.870
I try to keep my future in my crosshairs,

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:14.170
and even though my aim is unsteady,

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.510
I will hold my head high

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.180
I'll change my life,

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.220
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:30.060
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:35.980
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:42.700
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.890
Why are you going abroad?

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:04.100
No will to fight anymore.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.130
Don't go to America!

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.060
Karira!

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.430
This is Sono's decision.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.250
But...

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.770
Why didn't you tell us sooner?

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.230
Was this club just a pit stop for you?

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.100
No, of course not.

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.450
Then what are we to you?

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:22.560
Don't go!

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.190
I don't want you to leave!

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:25.410
I'm sorry.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.670
You're still calm and composed after all this, huh?

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.880
Sorry.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:35.750
Then... at least beat us before you leave!

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.490
Yeah! Good idea!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:42.090
We're the champions of the 24-h tournament!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:47.200
A skirm would suit our club more than some farewell party.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.080
I agree.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:51.020
Let's get started then!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.230
It's still light out.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.650
Um...

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.310
I'm sorry.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.400
I've still got lots of things to take care of.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.250
Hold your fire.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.670
Your movements are so inefficient.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:23.020
Guess you can't stand in for Sono after all.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:24.470
Sue me.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:29.060
I wonder how you'd have to move to be more like Sono.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:33.810
Yura could probably tell us in a heartbeat if she were here.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.220
Yeah.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.360
Going back to this lineup is pretty lonely.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.130
Yeah.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.720
I don't like this mood.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.470
Me neither.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.590
Let's go back.

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:51.730
Yeah.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.620
Stage clear.

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.900
Yura?

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.100
Oh hey. Ren.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.560
I didn't know you were watching me.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.260
Do you go to arcades too?

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:37.100
Huh? No, not really.

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.670
Darn, he got me.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.390
Do you have a minute, Yura?

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.390
Yeah, I'm listening.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:54.770
Sono is going to America at the end of the month.

00:04:56.550 --> 00:05:01.270
We talked about playing airsoft one last time together on the last weekend.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:06.090
Do you... want to say something?

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:09.050
How should I put it...

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:13.260
I quit airsoft.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:19.060
I was just a huge pain to everyone.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:22.310
If I picked airsoft up again, I bet it'd be more of the same.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:25.340
And if I just shouted "YOLO!" after all this,

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.760
I know it wouldn't end well.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:30.480
Are you serious?

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:34.410
I mean, even when I was a member, I know I didn't belong.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.380
I guess I just wasn't the right girl.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.470
But...

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.250
So yeah, that's that.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.400
It was short, but thanks for putting up—

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.660
Stop that!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.160
You're just running away on your own...

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:54.240
Maybe that will make you happy,

00:05:54.240 --> 00:06:00.210
but try to think about how Sono and everyone else would feel!

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.000
No way.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.230
Yeah.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.230
Is something wrong?

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:21.770
We ran into Yura earlier.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.580
Hey, Yura!

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.060
She got spooked and ran for the hills!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.810
It was a bit strange looking into her eyes.

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:36.340
She didn't have to get scared!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.650
Rento?

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.350
What's wrong?

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.050
I'm sorry!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:44.550
It's my fault!

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.130
Ren!

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.750
I'm ba...

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.990
What is it now?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.440
I see.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.250
I'm sorry.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.830
No, it's not your fault.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:05.730
But...

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:10.570
Even if you hadn't gone to her, one of us would have.

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.060
That's true.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:16.160
At this point, I just want her to come back.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.680
Sono won't be able to say goodbye either.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.040
Yeah.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.500
I saw her pacing around the clubroom the other day, you know?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.630
I bet she was hoping Yura would turn up.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.510
I saw her too.

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.260
Claimed she'd forgotten something.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:34.280
Like hell she did.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:37.260
She told us she was really busy.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:43.020
It'd be a pity if they couldn't say goodbye to each other.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.690
We can't let them.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.320
Then we know what we've gotta do!

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.410
We have to induct Yura into the club again!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.320
I think the cake strategy was good.

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.080
You sure like that one, don't you?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.200
Then I will—

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.210
Do whatever! Now let's get rollin'!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.300
I'm back.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.600
Rice Ball
for Yura

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.510
Yura?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.690
No way she'd come in through the window, huh?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.140
Wait!

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.220
Here.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.760
You can have my rice ball.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.740
You look like her.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.290
Time to start packing.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.140
Keep it together.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.470
Yura?

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:49.860
What is with that look?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.490
Thanks for the dried plums.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:59.450
They're still not as good as our teacher's.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.800
Don't worry.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.620
They'll be great.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.250
I'd like to talk about her.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.160
Yura?

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:09.580
I apologize for completely alienating her.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.090
I was conceited.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:18.100
I couldn't save her from the dark side with my idea of strength.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.350
My idea of strength lies in victory.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.450
This is out of character for you.

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:27.210
Aren't the rest of your teammates really happy with you?

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.830
I suppose.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:34.260
We've both changed a lot, but you've always been strong.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:39.530
All I did was just accept everything.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:46.870
I accepted our teacher's death, our separation, and now, Yura's resignation.

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:52.920
I just ran away into my serenity instead of facing it.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.130
I'm a terrible person.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.340
Then you should drop the calm facade first.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.250
You're not the first person to tell me.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.880
You don't have the looks for it.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.350
I'll walk you home.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:15.070
She might still have her weaknesses, but she practiced very diligently.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.240
She was consumed by a soldier's mentality.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.540
Like you once were.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:24.750
Will you be like that again?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:28.590
Will you be the Kashima Sonora I once knew?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:30.470
Rin...

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.220
This is far enough.

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.270
All the best.

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.310
You too.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:03.610
Let's put the "Sticking memorable items under Yura's nose to appeal to her feelings" strategy into action!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.870
Hey! What about this?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.910
That might make it worse.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.580
Then let's use this!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.530
I like the rough image!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.220
We have this too.

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:16.180
Great!

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:18.340
I can still smell the sea salt!

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.170
What's that?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.050
Oh, her entry form?

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:26.210
Did she really hand that in?

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:29.010
Maybe Sono was hanging onto it until now.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.240
Great job, Rento.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.860
That's sure to bring back memories!

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.530
Let's not do this after all.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.570
What? Why?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:42.440
It just feels like we're forcing ourselves onto her.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.320
It's kind of...

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.140
Egotistical?

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.250
Yeah.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.790
Something like that.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:52.540
I suppose you could see it like that.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.360
I don't really think so.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:13:01.170
Yura did so much for us before and during the 24-h tournament.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.600
Her special training?

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:04.610
Yeah, her training.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.430
That sure was something else.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.850
We should have shown some gratitude!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:14.940
All we did was ignore her sacrifices.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:19.500
I should have told her when I hurt my leg, too.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:26.210
It was egotistical of me to stay quiet when I wanted her to stay with us!

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:27.640
Ren...

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:32.900
So, egotistically forcing ourselves onto her isn't the way to go?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:38.920
Yeah, it might only push her away even more.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:44.310
I'd love to see her return of her own volition, though.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.600
Farewell Tournament for Sono

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.600
All the best!

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.820
Sorry it took me so long.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:18.020
Did your class throw you a farewell party?

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.170
Yeah.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.270
Yura isn't here.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:25.800
I've been here for the last hour and gave her a call, too.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.600
I figured sending her a text with the time and place couldn't hurt either.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.430
I see.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:36.260
It's a pity, but let's get that off our minds now.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:38.530
This is the big farewell tournament.

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:39.600
Yeah.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:43.290
And just so you know, I'm not letting you board the plane if you don't win again me!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.730
All right then.

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:49.150
One game will last 15 minutes.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.040
As for the rules...

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.450
Just take me on.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:52.950
That'll do.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.810
You got it!

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.200
When the bell rings five minutes after...

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.330
The game starts!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:09.720
Mom, Dad... I'm sorry.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:13.550
I didn't change at all.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.610
Did you get into a fight again?

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:25.600
Did you make up again?

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:27.480
We did!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.110
Ren?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.180
Are you okay?

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.670
Sorry!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.060
Temporarily Closed

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.830
Did you return my cell phone earlier?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:16.600
That wasn't me!

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:21.980
It's raining.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:31.210
The rain's obscuring her tracks.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.820
Yeah.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.550
The rain is siding with her.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:49.430
<i>There's no place I belong.</i>

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.140
Don't cry!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.140
This is...

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.640
Come seek shelter from the rain.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:27.770
Choujirou?!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.390
I hope the rain never ends.

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:46.080
Why?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:50.360
Because then I could stay here forever.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:53.380
I have nowhere else to go.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:57.550
Regrettably, there has never been a rain with no end.

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:00.640
Can you make it so it never ends?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.560
Aren't you a spirit, Choujirou?

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:07.000
I do not work at people's bidding.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:11.730
But I really have nowhere to go.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:16.570
Nobody anywhere accepts me.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.700
Is it not enough if you accept yourself?

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:22.020
Just me alone?

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:23.590
That's weird.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.400
It is not.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.780
Would you accept one...

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.540
who could not accept herself?

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:39.970
Even then, I could never back to the C3 club after all this!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.070
You can.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:49.270
This world here is both yours and mine.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.630
Did you forget that?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.650
Our worlds are resonating.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.570
The worlds you create are no mere illusions.

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:09.960
Careful, Choujirou!

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:12.070
The archer and his target...

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.710
are one and the same.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.630
Choujirou!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.150
Hey, Choujirou!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.150
Accept yourself,

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.140
and accept others.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.140
Do so, and the world will...

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.400
Choujirou...

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:24.660
The world will...

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:27.120
The place...

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.350
where I belong.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:44.760
Karira!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.260
Don't shoot from your hip!

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.820
Damn, man!

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:54.140
Hit!

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:58.580
Yachiyo!

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.480
Your heart rate is up!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.630
You have to relax.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.770
I can read you like a book!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.960
She's bluffing.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:12.750
Seriously?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.040
Hit!

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:21.080
Honoka, if you want to back up Rento, you should circle around to my right!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.760
Oh, come on!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.090
Hit.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:29.040
Is that all you've got, guys?

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.390
This was your last chance to beat me.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.120
Is there nobody who can give me a challenge?

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.050
We can't win.

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:44.500
She's just too strong.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.110
We're giving up. We lose.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.170
We can't compete with you.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:53.240
There's nobody in Japan who can face you.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.300
Then I guess that's the end of it.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.100
Command!

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:12.970
Control!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:15.230
Communication!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.270
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:16.890
Yay!

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:20.110
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:23.440
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:28.570
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.660
Yay!

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.790
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:38.620
but that's fine

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:41.750
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:42.750
Ready?

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:45.260
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.300
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:52.010
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.100
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:56.020
All right?

00:22:56.680 --> 00:22:58.640
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:01.980
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.820
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:11.910
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.620
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:14.160
Okay!

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:18.620
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:21.750
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:25.840
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:31.890
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:34.930
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:35.810
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.850 --> 00:24:09.670
Preview

00:23:40.510 --> 00:23:42.630
Tea's done, everyone.

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:44.560
Today we have royal milk tea with soy milk!

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:45.810
Thanks!

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:48.330
We also have pound cake with plum jam.

00:23:48.330 --> 00:23:50.280
Thanks!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:53.840
Nothing beats tea and cake!

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:55.640
This is the life.

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:56.740
Yeah.

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:58.720
Can we stay here?

00:23:58.720 --> 00:23:59.780
Can we?

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:03.210
All right, time to go.

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.250
Is it time?

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:05.420
Next episode.

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:09.670
Have fun and win!

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:08.540
Have fun and win!

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.500
Preview
